  "details": "Currently, the Personal Mirror can only be enabled or disabled through the in-game menus. There is no OSC endpoint for the Personal Mirror.\n\nPlease add an OSC input that toggles the Personal Mirror, e.g. /input/PersonalMirrorToggle.\n\nUse cases:\n\n- Toggling the mirror from external controllers (macro pads, Stream Deck, TouchOSC) while in VR, without opening menus in the middle of an activity\n\n- Automation tools that turn the mirror off when it is not needed (for performance) and back on when checking an avatar's appearance or outfit\n\n- Accessibility: users who find menu navigation difficult could bind the mirror to a single physical button\n\nThe Personal Mirror is a purely local, client-side feature, so exposing it via OSC would not affect other players. Thank you for considering this!",
